  The commissioner moves to block my path. In his hand is the sword Kuronose was wielding before he donned his armor. From his stance, it is clear that his skill is no less than its previous master's.

  But of course, I already knew that. If I was Hikaru's swordmaster, then this man was mine.

//　菊池明堯。
//　――人生の一時期のみ、湊斗明堯と名乗った。

