//　湊斗光の、<RUBY text='・・・・・・・・・'>父たり得なかった父</RUBY>。
  Kikuchi Akitaka. Once upon a time, Minato Akitaka.

  He was the man who adopted me.<K>
  And the man who failed to be Hikaru's father.

